# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in a real value for local development.
# `.env` is gitignored — never commit real API keys.

# Google Maps API key (Maps SDK for Android), used by expo-maps on the
# "Select Location" screen (see app.config.js). Restrict the key to your
# Android package (in.definestack.atplace) + debug/release SHA-1 fingerprints
# in the Google Cloud Console.
#
# This same key is also used from JS (via app.config.js `extra`) to call the
# Google Places API (New) Text Search endpoint for place search (issue #30) —
# make sure "Places API (New)" is enabled for it in the Google Cloud Console,
# and that its application restrictions allow the device's REST calls.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
